<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your experience with our Chauffeur Drive service.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If charged correctly use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We want your <b><i>-Business/First-</i></b> Class journey from {!Case.Departure_Airport__c}&nbsp;to {!Case.Arrival_Airport__c} to be seamless from the moment you are picked up at your door, right through to your arrival at your final destination, so we include complimentary Chauffeur Drive on this route. To make the service viable however, it is necessary to charge an additional fee for unusually long drives.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have checked your booking and confirm the excess mileage charge, was applied correctly on this occasion. We are therefore unable to meet your request for a refund.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If charged incorrectly use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We want your <b><i>-Business/First-</i></b> Class journey from {!Case.Departure_Airport__c}&nbsp;to {!Case.Arrival_Airport__c} to be seamless from the moment you are picked up at your door, right through to your arrival at your final destination, so I was disappointed to learn you were incorrectly charged.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have spoken with our transfer provider in -<b><i>CITY</i></b>- and they have confirmed the excess mileage fee should not have been applied on this occasion. <b><i>-Add explanation if provided by Chauffeur Drive company-</i></b><i>.</i> Please accept my apology on behalf of Qantas Airways.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have arranged a refund of the incorrect fee charged and this should reflect in the balance of the card used to make the payment in approximately 7 business days.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you again for taking the time to write to us and we hope that we can welcome you on board again in the future.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
